# Single-agent mode (project default)

- Do **not** use the Task tool or `/multitask` to spawn parallel background subagents.
- Work sequentially in the main agent: read, edit, run commands, report results.
- Only delegate to a subagent if the user explicitly requests multitask, parallel agents, or a background worker.
